WEBVTT

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:08.360
It's in your eyes, a color fake cloud

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:13.830
And you treasure the starting out

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.020
And shaking your ground

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:22.100
Turn in your head to see and you take off

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:28.520
Does it feel you to leave?

00:00:30.668 --> 00:00:34.748
A snapshot from where you were born
